                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/1003.5944"}> preprint
                )
            %li#RRZ04
              %p
                M. La Palme Reyes,
                = succeed "," do
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Gonzalo+E.+Reyes"} G. E. Reyes
                %em Generic Figures and their Glueings
                , Polimetrica Milano 2004.
            %li#Law76
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/William+Lawvere"}> William Lawvere
                ,
                %em Variable Quantities and Variable Structures in Topoi
                , pp.101-131 in Heller, Tierney (eds.),
                %em Algebra, Topology and Category Theory: a Collection of Papers in Honor of Samuel Eilenberg
                , Academic Press New York 1976.
            %li#Law86
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/William+Lawvere"}> F. W. Lawvere
                ,
                %em Introduction
